{"id":"vod_sn_37070","vodId":"37070","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"幻灵镇魂曲","name_cn":"幻灵镇魂曲","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c3bab7b377622bee99c6fd17224fc6e8.jpg"},"summary":"吾妻玲二（入野自由 配音）本是一介普通的少年，一次偶然中，他被卷入了一起黑社会暗杀事件之中，作为目击证人，玲二被列入了“消抹名单”之中。组织内部的洗脑专家家塞斯（千叶一伸 配音）发现了玲二体内所隐藏的强大力量，如获至宝的他消除了玲二的记忆，取名Zwei，并致力将他培养成为新一代出色的杀人机器。　　负责训练玲二的少女名叫Ein（高桓彩阳 配音），她同玲二一样没有过去的记忆。尽管Ein表面上冷静从容，但在内心里，她一直在逃避着同时作为“人”和“机器”这之间无法调节的矛盾。在和玲二相处的日子里，Ein的人性被重新唤醒，她意识到了自己危险的处境，不愿意再被人利用的Ein和玲二约定，两人决心逃出组织的掌控，重新回归自由的生活。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x21twqnmJ81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p4S4t5vUry1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r0K2dFNXUe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kQCfHXuTQr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0UGVdfQ3zA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sTjvL2BTqL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eBwv7CJtLv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sdvEWn3GNL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VJ6szhEYQe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gDxtXUsuNg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gjmh76PG6A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uM0QQhWbqb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0Y7tEKPhXF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dm34v76Vww1/video/i